188
00:12:50,661 --> 00:12:53,660
This is where your car will have the windows washed

189
00:12:53,661 --> 00:12:56,660
and the interior vacuumed while it rides on the conveyor belt

190
00:12:56,661 --> 00:12:59,660
that moves the vehicle and the employees at the same time.

191
00:13:00,660 --> 00:13:03,660
The employees will vacuum with vacuums that are actuated

192
00:13:03,661 --> 00:13:06,260
are actuated by sensors that only turn on

193
00:13:06,261 --> 00:13:08,900
once the employee has picked the vacuum nozzle up

194
00:13:08,901 --> 00:13:10,460
off of its holder.

195
00:13:10,461 --> 00:13:12,000
Once a worker lifts the nozzle,

196
00:13:12,001 --> 00:13:13,500
it triggers a torrent of suction

197
00:13:13,501 --> 00:13:16,000
operated by a high-powered vacuum.

198
00:13:16,001 --> 00:13:18,040
And high-powered is an understatement.

199
00:13:18,041 --> 00:13:23,120
We have a 20 horsepower motor, a vacuum producer,

200
00:13:23,121 --> 00:13:26,160
a filter bag, a dirt collector.

201
00:13:26,161 --> 00:13:29,480
This unit is capable of handling eight vacuum cleaners

202
00:13:29,481 --> 00:13:30,600
at one time.

203
00:13:30,601 --> 00:13:33,940
It is so strong it can hold a 16-pound bowling ball.

204
00:13:33,941 --> 00:13:34,780
Turn it on.

205
00:13:38,740 --> 00:13:41,940
This vacuum cleaner can suck up anything out of your car,

206
00:13:41,941 --> 00:13:43,740
sucks out all the nooks, crannies,

207
00:13:43,741 --> 00:13:45,200
all your typical dirt and debris

208
00:13:45,201 --> 00:13:46,600
that you normally would have.

209
00:13:46,601 --> 00:13:47,840
As you can see, it's so strong,

210
00:13:47,841 --> 00:13:50,780
it's hard for me to even pull the bowling ball

211
00:13:50,781 --> 00:13:52,840
